            "notes": "[Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) is a **must pick!!**\nYou need to build this power, as it amps up your healing to 100. You can heal a lot with it, even through anti heal.\n\nFor items, you should buy [Extendrils](item_138e73a2-6915-4ffc-bd89-029a85bf94b8) for even better healing. If you can't afford it and you're broke AF, just buy [Custom Stock](item_17d633af-8bcc-4893-b865-be0a7bc66fe2) or sell [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) to afford it.\n\n [Multiball](item_5d0e4135-f4e1-42fb-991a-417643064560) gives you so much power that you should win this round comfortably. You need to play more passively, as you're not building any resistances, so risky plays are a no go from now on. But damage boosting your teammates really helps with that + it gives good ult charge to them!",
